KiR9EuDcuxUI.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvQW5pbWVzLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9XaXphcmRzJTIwVGFsZXMlMjBvZiUyMEFyY2FkaWElMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Lady of the Lake","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Merlin leads his ragtag crew on a quest to restore Excalibur and save Camelot. Elsewhere, Jim tries to convince Blinky that they're on the same side.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mv03EaPwwZS8XRVwU87sQWfZFyj.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvQW5pbWVzLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9XaXphcmRzJTIwVGFsZXMlMjBvZiUyMEFyY2FkaWElMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Battle Royal","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Morgana takes a new title — Mother of Monsters — and vows to usher in an age of reckoning. An epic battle begins in King Arthur's court.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kYi92AEXShSOZEM1VIjpj99OOem.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvQW5pbWVzLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9XaXphcmRzJTIwVGFsZXMlMjBvZiUyMEFyY2FkaWElMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Killahead, Part One","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Arthur seeks an alliance with the trolls of Dwoza as Gunmar begins building his army. Merlin and Douxie join forces to forge the amulet.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aD6XqYp0hR3yTP2Pm1gOek0XHUz.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvQW5pbWVzLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9XaXphcmRzJTIwVGFsZXMlMjBvZiUyMEFyY2FkaWElMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Killahead, Part Two","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2020-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With the fateful battle underway, every hero must do their part to stop the Arcane Order, banish Gunmar and ensure that history plays out as it should.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9W8hrmaPzp6WjkT7bjTY2L81luk.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvQW5pbWVzLzIwMTEtMjAyM